Package: oocolrm
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: COLUMN STRIPPER
 Strips character columns from line streams using precise byte column boundaries.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 tab expansion, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
